ess' activity revokes remote access if necessary.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Setup Remote Access\",\"description\":\"The 'Setup Remote Access' activity sets up remote access for the employee after approval.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"Whenever a 'Complete Survey' activity occurs, it must be immediately followed by a 'Notify Employee' activity in the next event position, with no other events in between within 0 to 72 hours. The 'Notify Employee' activity is allowed to happen isolated.\",\"template\":\"Chain Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Complete Survey\",\"description\":\"The 'Complete Survey' activity involves the employee completing a performance survey.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Notify Employee\",\"description\":\"The 'Notify Employee' activity notifies the employee about the request outcome.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,72,h\",\"cardinality\":null}]}"